cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this corpus, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Caribbean Metadata Standard NLP Corpus"
abstract: >
  The first official Caribbean cultural NLP corpus, built under the 
  Caribbean Metadata Standard (CMS) v1.0. Covers 8 Caribbean languages 
  and creoles, 15 cultural markers, and 8 territories. Designed not just 
  as a linguistic resource but as a cultural certification instrument — 
  the first standard to describe, certify and protect Caribbean cultural 
  works on global digital platforms.
authors:
  - name: "Caribbean Metadata Standard Initiative"
    website: "https://caribbeanmetadata.org"
    email: "contact@caribbeanmetadata.org"
    location: "Guadeloupe, Caribbean"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-05-11"
license: "CC-BY-4.0"
